  "description": {
    "en-US": "Dante’s Convivio in the English of Elizabeth Price Sayer (1887), as The Banquet (Il Convito): four treatises, with the canzoni in verse. Sayer’s chapters do not follow the Italian chapter for chapter (treatise II has 16, against 15 in the Italian text), so this is a separate book of the same work as the Italian Convivio. The translator’s preface and her note on the date of the Convito are not imported.",
    "pt-BR": "O Convivio de Dante na versão inglesa de Elizabeth Price Sayer (1887): quatro tratados, com as canções em verso. A divisão em capítulos difere do texto italiano."
  },
  "composed": "1304-1307",
