      "url": "https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/12867",
      "edition": "The Banquet (Il Convito) of Dante Alighieri, translated by Elizabeth Price Sayer (London: Routledge, 1887), Project Gutenberg #12867.",
      "description": "Four treatises with the canzoni (as separate chapters) and 74 chapters. The preface, the table of contents and the note on the date of the work are dropped. Wicksteed’s Temple Classics version (1903) is OCR only and not imported.",
      "tier": "A",
      "tierEvidence": "Published 1887; Project Gutenberg distributes it."
    }
  ],
